        "TileImage": "$($repository 233503c3-d3bd-4900-b501-90d4c95b03d4).Image",
        "Description": "The Bluberry muffins murders have finally been solved. This cold case went on for years before we could prove that Helen West, an old woman living in Whittleton Creek and her accomplices have been poisonning older people and make the bodies disappear in Helen&apos;s furnace inside her basement. The victims&apos;s families contacted us to avenge their loved ones. Let&apos;s bring peace to those poor people.",
